{
  "name": "Leads del sitio web a HubSpot sin duplicados",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Leads a HubSpot sin duplicados\nPlantilla de **Moss Nexus**.\n\n**Antes de activar:**\n1. Credencial de HubSpot (token de app privada) en «Crear o actualizar».\n2. Slack y canal en «Avisar a ventas».\n3. Cuenta de Google y URL de la hoja en «Leads para revisar» (pestaña **Revisar**: Fecha, Correo, Datos recibidos).\n4. Apunta tu formulario web a la URL de producción de «Lead recibido» (POST con JSON).",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 400
      },
      "id": "6dfa19b5-5d08-4c5b-8de9-88c575ab06bc",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "nuevo-lead",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18222ea0-b6b4-4165-8fa4-1deefc437ac6",
      "name": "Lead recibido",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "635fc1ab-e627-46c2-8442-b5d0c5a18585"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "0849fb7c-e501-4318-855f-f831bf73154f",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.email ?? '').trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "23352474-b407-48a9-8193-f83ce5db33a5",
              "name": "nombre",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.nombre ?? '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1fe01ee0-8c73-4bc9-8ca4-7b0d74c568bb",
              "name": "apellido",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.apellido ?? '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "3e12147c-c32f-4cdb-8c25-8a33aac88782",
              "name": "telefono",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.telefono ?? '').replace(/[^\\d+]/g, '') }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4acbd524-3c44-4534-8e21-2185f03adddb",
              "name": "empresa",
              "value": "={{ String($json.body.empresa ?? '').trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "60399c5a-30ca-45ff-8a63-9feffaad72ff",
              "name": "origen",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.origen || 'Sitio web' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9cfc5200-5728-4ab3-86e6-1bcc62fa1b91",
      "name": "Normalizar datos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Correo en minúsculas y sin espacios: así «Ana@Empresa.com » y «ana@empresa.com» son el mismo contacto.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "fa4c0ac1-1f58-4e06-818e-a11f2be72174",
              "leftValue": "={{ /^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test($json.email) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9e857a3c-0143-4956-8be8-e46db0ae0eca",
      "name": "¿Correo válido?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "appToken",
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "email": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "firstName": "={{ $json.nombre }}",
          "lastName": "={{ $json.apellido }}",
          "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.telefono }}",
          "companyName": "={{ $json.empresa }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "421b9c75-f476-40f5-81c6-784ae5904d37",
      "name": "Crear o actualizar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.hubspot",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        680,
        -100
      ],
      "notes": "HubSpot busca el contacto por correo: si existe lo actualiza, si no lo crea. Nunca duplica.",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#ventas",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=:handshake: Lead sincronizado en HubSpot: *{{ $('Normalizar datos').item.json.nombre }} {{ $('Normalizar datos').item.json.apellido }}*{{ $('Normalizar datos').item.json.empresa ? ' · ' + $('Normalizar datos').item.json.empresa : '' }} ({{ $('Normalizar datos').item.json.email }}). Origen: {{ $('Normalizar datos').item.json.origen }}.",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "2454e4bb-5665-42a1-8a98-9802b396a2ac",
      "name": "Avisar a ventas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Revisar",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Fecha": "={{ $now.toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm') }}",
            "Correo": "={{ $json.email }}",
            "Datos recibidos": "={{ JSON.stringify($('Lead recibido').item.json.body) }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "Fecha",
              "displayName": "Fecha",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Correo",
              "displayName": "Correo",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "Datos recibidos",
              "displayName": "Datos recibidos",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW"
        }
      },
      "id": "17010ba0-1f78-4df5-8c49-862131647e05",
      "name": "Leads para revisar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        680,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
